Case: MOBILE-BANKING-APPid: MOBILE-BANKING-APPtype: featuretitle: Cross-Platform Mobile Banking Applicationpurpose: Build secure cross-platform mobile banking appstatus: DRAFTstate: -created: 2026-08-27updated: 2026-08-27depends_on:  - PAYMENT-INTEGRATION  - USER-AUTHproduces:  - mobile/ios-app  - mobile/android-app  - backend/mobile-api  - shared/kmp-module  - tests/e2echain: featuretemplate: modular-featurestages:  AN: -  AR: -  DB: -  BE: -  API: -  FE: -  MD: -  QA: -  DO: -  VR: -tech_stack:  languages:    - kotlin (L1-L2 android)    - swift (L1-L2 ios)    - typescript (L3 backend)    - dart (L1 flutter)  frameworks:    - kotlin-multiplatform (L1 shared)    - swiftui (L1 ios)    - jetpack-compose (android)    - flutter (L1-L2 cross-platform)    - nextjs (admin panel)  databases:    - postgresql (L3-L4 enterprise)    - redis (L1 caching)    - sqlite (local)  platforms:    - docker (L2 multi-stage)    - kubernetes (L1)    - terraform (L1)    - aws (L1)  cross-cutting:    - testing: e2e, integration, bdd    - security: authentication, authorization, encryption    - architecture: clean-architecture, ddd    - observability: logging, metrics, tracingrules:  [B1] All transactions MUST be biometric authenticated.  [B2] Offline mode MUST be supported.  [B3] All data MUST be encrypted at rest and in transit.  [B4] Session MUST timeout after inactivity.  [B5] All API calls MUST be idempotent.  [B6] Push notifications MUST be secure.  [B7] App MUST pass penetration testing.  [B8] All personal data MUST be GDPR compliant.decisions:  - id: MBA-001    title: Cross-platform strategy    status: pending    options:      - kotlin multiplatform shared logic      - flutter full cross-platform      - native per platform  - id: MBA-002    title: Authentication method    status: pending    options:      - biometric + pin      - biometric only      - biometric + passwordapproval_required:  - MBA-001  - MBA-002provisioning:  triggers:    - api gateway    - redis cluster    - push notification service    - cdn   State: -State: +